{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"11022","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:11022","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"ZUN","creatorId":"egs:creator:2843","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2843","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:2843","name":"ZUN","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"alias-only-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:71817","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"ZUN","creatorId":"egs:creator:2843","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2843","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:2843","name":"ZUN","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"alias-only-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:71818","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"ZUN","creatorId":"egs:creator:2843","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2843","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:2843","name":"ZUN","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"alias-only-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:71819","source":"egs"}],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10485","characterName":"神出鬼没の妖怪 / 神出鬼沒的妖怪","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"10485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"神出鬼没の妖怪 / 神出鬼沒的妖怪","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隙间妖怪。平常都待在她的隙间里面，是个力量非常强大的妖怪，平常睡十二个小时，外加冬眠，杂事大多交由她的式神-八云蓝（九尾狐）去做。和幽幽子是旧识。紫能够操纵任何事物的界线(例如她把山与湖的界线消去,两个事物都不复存在)。存在了多久，无人知晓(原作中她并不介意别人谈论她的年龄，甚至还会以此自我消遣)，只能得知她在幻想乡出现时就存在了。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10485"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10485","value":"妖怪"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10485","value":"操纵境界的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd979f2021d1fe99ccdad25d7d1965c9b3b12e5414d0ec5fb4c8481e487645c6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9f/9fbaf945e2b33aa4d13e25c5af042febbff138deed2ee19f9fec6a164f048dfa.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10796","characterName":"七色の人形使い \\ 七色的人偶使","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"150819"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"七色の人形使い \\ 七色的人偶使","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"爱丽丝·玛格特罗依德（Alice Margatroid，アリス·マーガトロイド）东方同人游戏系列中的一个角色，住在魔法森林的魔法使，总是拿着一本魔导书的少女。最早登场于《东方怪绮谈》，后来在《东方妖妖梦》中再次登场，获得了不错的人气。人物设定上旧五作和新作有较大区别，怪绮谈中设定爱丽丝是魔族（魔界人），但新作设定她“原本是人类，经过修行后就成为了称为「魔法使」的种族”。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796","value":"魔法使"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796","value":"操控人偶程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796","value":"操纵魔法程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afbe91c817a0795a52ff7b9e241d9a5d519667ce8f7927672bd25dddff296112.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/813408c8cffd5267b40d160885859319fb88a8487926f1878d75702aca8a3f72.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_16659","characterName":"本怖！貴方の後ろにいるよ \\ 本怖！就在你的身后","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"16659","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"16659","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"本怖！貴方の後ろにいるよ \\ 本怖！就在你的身后","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"东方地灵殿，古明地姉妹之妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她与觉一样拥有读心术，但她知道人们讨厌这种能力，因此将能读心的第三只眼紧闭。不过却获得了操控无意识程度的能力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其实自身的读心能力并没有消失，但是读取的内容会被写入潜意识而隐没。而本人也是在潜意识下行动，无法让人察觉到她的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平时在地上与地灵殿间漫无目的地游荡。偶尔会出现在地面，但因为本身的能力，即使看到她只要注意力分散很快就会忘掉她。其实也有很多地底的妖怪对于恋的现状感到很自责。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16659"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16659","value":"觉"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"16659","value":"操控无意识程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/47bd4d07632a3ef03c8dcf6036d0f48d2a761853b0e4058f2a71d07239a5d3d0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0be5c300dd2605d866daeb801b41f0102be0ebf4f7a06e7a548b84aa714034ec.webp","width":149,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_17683","characterName":"語られる怪力乱神 / 人所谈论的怪力乱神","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"17683","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"17683","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"語られる怪力乱神 / 人所谈论的怪力乱神","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人之所谓怪力乱神"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"《东方地灵殿》 三面BOSS"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和萃香一起曾经被称为山中四天王的鬼族一员。现居住于旧都中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"旧都过去虽然曾经是地狱的一部分，是伴随着地狱小型化计划而被废弃的土地。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"这里虽然有居住着各种各样的妖怪，但其中具有代表性的妖怪便是鬼族。鬼族对于人类的欺骗行为感到厌恶决定主动离开，利用地狱多余的土地构建了新的社会。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同时鬼族也积极的率先接收那些在地上同样遭到欺骗耍弄的妖怪。对此事产生危机感的地上妖怪们，作为承认新的地底都市的条件提出了一个要求。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"那便是由他们来封印地底的怨灵。相对的定下了任何妖怪都不得进入地下都市的约定。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"鬼们完全断绝了与地上的交流，不为人知的开始了全新的社会生活。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勇仪和其他鬼一样，每天一边嬉闹一边喝酒，快乐的享受着生活。突然听说有强大的人类来此，虽然酒才喝到一半但还是慌忙前去想一探究竟……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"--------------------------------------------------------"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有着刚毅且乾脆利落的性格。喜欢力气大、有勇气以及正直的人们，相反饶不过那些懦弱的、胆小的、狡猾的人们。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"17683"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"17683","value":"鬼"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"17683","value":"拥有怪力乱神程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c037b247a573fa74ba8a4bcbbc76983fdfd56958f891fcd5ce039ea3fd250be3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c89edd6a8bd2a847ee3e1aeeb494425c8ef5d605152cdb8f833d2e6ecf1287c7.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20129","characterName":"超妖怪弹头","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20129","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"20129","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"20129","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"超妖怪弹头","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"人气弹幕系列游戏《东方project》的主要角色。妖怪山的全能水利工程师，外貌为穿戴“太阳帽、探险制服、登山套鞋”的双马尾少女，左手拿着狗尾草，总是背着一个大包包。初次登场是在《东方风神录》。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20129"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20129","value":"河童"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20129","value":"操纵水程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/984ff1f6d554bb899d5e0bba41a209f8b0631802b21aa7b20f2abf9cb04ed3c4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cb6582adcbc425f59b1e15618739a986f9e7dd4ccbcf366fda037222ed8788cf.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20130","characterName":"やさか かなこ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20130","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"20130","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"20130","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"やさか かなこ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"守矢神社所供奉的神明"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为在外界得不到信仰的关系，所以和早苗一起决定将守矢神社迁进幻想乡，希望能在幻想乡内收集到信仰"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"刚进入幻想乡时一直被天狗们警戒着，后来经过交涉之后和解"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格豪爽，大方，不拘小节。非常开朗，头脑也很明晰"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为从外界来的关系，似乎对外界的技术和科学知识有着高度的了解"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"爱好技术革命，不过似乎是因为为了获得信仰？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢宴会，和人类与妖怪游玩是她希望的信仰方式"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主导著守矢神社的信仰心"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原本是风神，不过在经过许多波折之后变成了山神"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"符卡名均来源于诹访神社的传说与惯例"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20130"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20130","value":"神灵"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20130","value":"创造乾程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a44ce4116037db504edf0f96e12a72ee75eb8179940c6c406ab2be957783b72d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f7b49b41c9035985fdc531476abd6b33b0ef40d62813c31bb73069f8a1e03cb.webp","width":182,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20131","characterName":"土著神的顶点","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20131","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"20131","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"20131","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"土著神的顶点","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"守矢神社真正供奉的神明"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在远古时候拥有非常恐怖的信仰心，作为神的同时甚至作为王建立了一个王国"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为在和神奈子的战斗中败北而投降，将王国交出"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过因为神奈子无法得到王国人们的信仰，而变成了在神奈子背后一起治理着王国的情况"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"随着时间的流逝，诹访子渐渐的被人们所遗忘，记得诹访子真名的人，也几乎没有了"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"此时神奈子决定将守矢神社迁到幻想乡内，从此诹访子在幻想乡内开始了新的生活"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"诹访子是早苗遥远的祖先，不过早苗对此却完全不知情"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20131"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20131","value":"神明（土著神）"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20131","value":"创造坤（地）程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a5241709cc4571e16292d3daf08de9ffd9fb5f6db2b70ca6b885ec975bde2bd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b1c313ab7a2dae13aac5be7b8ebef0080b78598e66c51adc21543ad533c2e46b.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_20132","characterName":"怨灵也为之恐惧的少女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20132","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"20132","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"怨灵也为之恐惧的少女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"古明地觉是地底都市遗迹里残留着的怨灵的管理者，在灼热地狱遗址上建立起了地灵殿，她就在那里居住了下来。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为她能够读取他人心中的想法，不管是任何妖怪，连怨灵都为之感到恐惧，不知从何时起几乎没有人再来地灵殿造访了。但是，相反因为能读心而受到那些不会说话的动物们的喜爱。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为宠物的增多，导致灼热地狱遗迹无法完美的管理，最后只得把很多管理事项交由宠物们去做。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当她听说间歇泉的异变时，她也稍微的吃了一惊。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20132"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20132","value":"妖怪"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20132","value":"可以读心程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/658acbb6b479fc0e665ff64772860298e68fa5c997636c103ac9b366c2486bc3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/60d7e893599652164586f7afb5c698d18a439847dbb0fc6742c25a74053973f1.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29659","characterName":"Kisume","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29659","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"29659","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Kisume","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"走在夜路上的时候突然从正上方掉落，撞在头顶上的恐怖妖怪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平常都呆在洞窟或者水井里。非常喜欢狭窄的地方所以一直都在桶里，是个内向的妖怪。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29659"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29659","value":"吊瓶妖"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29659","value":"降下鬼火程度的能力（地灵殿）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f23dcab0f04210660748468db1f5e039b2aa446c8cc94dcf6fc34a0f75fa24b9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf89775ab77a40ebb39f85dd979d9fa4baf0f28cb758fa61e1f31ce029a0b329.webp","width":127,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29663","characterName":"熱かい悩む神の火 \\ 难以驾驭的神之火","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29663","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"29663","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"29663","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"熱かい悩む神の火 \\ 难以驾驭的神之火","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"有着特别姿态的鸦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"左足是\"分解之足\"、右足是\"融合之足\"、还有制御两者的右手\"第三足\"，她以这三足操控着究极的能源。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"空的任务是看守灼热地狱遗迹让它不至失控。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身体内拥有称为八咫乌的神明。八咫乌拥有的究极之力量，就是创造原子的力量－核融合。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29663"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29663","value":"地狱鸦"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29663","value":"操控核融合的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5a8f00e72e6f71036bfa2e12f115bc7d5926836508d108490855c7a61d1380f6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70c7d8199a57908f09f3d5f093898b1640380f3f3060c3458c304db9d4e98172.webp","width":212,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29685","characterName":"Kurodani Yamame","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29685","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"29685","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Kurodani Yamame","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/3039c349faa4213a157b43158b98f96fdff7eb4939d515872846b3a8b82c1c90.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e302716ce117faf00a4d08bc74c3a51a96e58fadba7da53808ec78d00925cc26.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29686","characterName":"Mizuhashi Parsee","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29686","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"29686","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Mizuhashi Parsee","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力 操纵嫉妒心程度的能力"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"危险度 中"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人类友好度 完全没有"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主要活动场所 旧地狱"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"居住在地底的妖怪，桥姬。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"现在的旧地狱成了受人厌恶者的栖息地，她也是其中的一位。总之是个嫉妒心很强的妖怪。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"煽动人们心中的嫉妒。看着他们因嫉妒而疯狂，生活逐渐崩溃的样子，并以此做为粮食。在她看来被嫉妒所驱使的人类是不可或缺的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她的嫉妒是没有情理可言的。只要一觉得别人过得比自己幸福就会发作起来。如果别人和自己一样的话，就会夸耀说自己更加不幸一些。就算对方比自己更加不幸，只要对方不来嫉妒自己，也会因为对方的这份宽容而嫉妒。如果对方来嫉妒自己的话，这份嫉妒就会成为自己的粮食。走火入魔到这种程度。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"但这并不意味着她本身也很不幸。只要有人心生嫉妒，她的力量便会无穷无尽，也没人会想去要她的命。她听说旧地狱聚集了不少被人厌恶的同伴。嫉妒者也并非全是不幸者吧。正相反，因为这这份嫉妒，所以才会看起来是不幸的样子吧。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是个妖怪，却有着人类的性格。称之为嫉妒心本身也丝毫不为过。跟她进行直接对话的时候会给人一种很普通的开朗的感觉，但心中却已是波澜万丈。之后会在背地里使劲说你坏话，并对你怨恨起来。让人感觉十分的不好。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"丑时参拜"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有种咒术叫做丑时参拜。这是心怀强烈怨恨的人类暗地里进行复仇的著名咒术。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其实丑时参拜就是她开发的东西，这种说法广为流传。虽然没有正式的做法，但是在午夜两点半的时候把稻草人钉在木头上，作法的时候不能被任何人看到是共通点。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"关于这个咒术的成功报告很少。因为这个咒术本身并没有什么复仇的意思。作法的人负担很大，一个劲地增强嫉妒心对于他人来说根本算不上什么咒术。（×1 最多也就是后背激灵一下子的程度。）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可是为什么，这种毫无效果的咒术会广为流传呢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"丑时参拜是增强嫉妒心的咒术。从这一点出发结论只有一个，丑时参拜就是她创作的咒术吧。劝诱人类去进行丑时参拜，煽动他们的嫉妒心，使其成为自己的力量。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"对应方法"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不要被她挑唆成功了就好。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她有着促进嫉妒心膨胀的强大力量，如果没有可以承受下来的精神力，便会自取灭亡。很多人类就是因为抗拒着嫉妒心，就活生生成为了她的粮食。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"就算与她遭遇，和她打个招呼程度的话应该是没什么问题的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"如果不幸被嫉妒所驱使的话，那就喝点酒发泄一下吧。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29686"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29686","value":"操纵嫉妒心程度的能力（地灵殿、求闻口授）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c87412d808f1c8c89e12628a30fd6489717af06c8118f51deea1fa3f306ef04c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2d0a538c3d6c2e82257c25c97857c072f4b590a18e9b419e38585cac70a83e9b.webp","width":142,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29687","characterName":"Kaenbyou Rin","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29687","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"29687","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"29687","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Kaenbyou Rin","characterNameSource":null,"role":"